{"id":"u-53be8c9d-160e-4218-bfb5-9b61f05e7718","src":"community","title":"Evidence-Based 4-Day Concurrent Training Program","author":"Felipe Rojas","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/3HL3JK-evidence-based-4-day-concurrent-training-program","desc":"Hypertrophy priority with concurrent strength/power development and suboptimal recovery, this is a Daily Undulating Periodization (DUP) model across 4 days with strategic volume allocation.\n\nWeekly Structure:\nDay 1: Lower Strength-Power \nDay 2: Upper Hypertrophy \nDay 3: Lower Hypertrophy \nDay 4: Upper Strength-Power\n\nRationale:\n48-72hr recovery between muscle groups\nLower frequency (2x/week per muscle) appropriate for recovery constraints\nStrength work early-week when freshest; hypertrophy when CNS fatigue accumulates\n\nRecovery Protocols\nNon-Negotiables:\nSleep Optimization Attempt: Target 7hrs minimum\nEarlier bedtime protocol, sleep hygiene interventions\nImpact: Each hour of sleep debt = ~5-10% performance decrement (Fullagar 2015)\nStress Management:\n10min daily breathwork/meditation\nConsider adaptogenic supplementation (Ashwagandha 300-600mg if appropriate)\nDeload Sensitivity:\nGiven recovery constraints, mandatory deload every 4-5 weeks\nWatch for: plateau, elevated RHR, mood disturbance, libido drop\nIntra-Week Recovery:\nDays 3, 5, 6, 7: Active recovery (walking, mobility, sauna if available)\nPost-workout: 10min cool-down walk\n\nProgression Protocols\nStrength Days (Days 1, 4):\nLinear progression:\nAdd 2.5kg when hit top of rep range at target RPE for all sets\nIf fail, repeat weight next week with better execution\nHypertrophy Days (Days 2, 3):\nDouble progression:\nAdd reps within range (e.g., 8→10)\nWhen hit top of range all sets, add 5% load, reset to bottom range\nWhen to Adjust:\nRegressing 2+ weeks: Drop volume by 2 sets per muscle group\nSurging energy: Add 1 set to lagging body parts\n\nExercise Substitutions (Aligned with Preferences)\nIf Programming Calls For\nYou Can Substitute\nBulgarian Split Squat\nWalking Lunges, Leg Press (single-leg), Step-Ups\nRDL\nLeg Curl variations, Good Mornings (if tolerated), 45° Back Extension\nBarbell Rows\nChest-Supported Row, T-Bar Row, Seal Row\nFree Weight Overhead\nMachine Shoulder Press, Landmine Press\n\n\nKey Performance Indicators (Track These)\nEvery 3 Weeks:\nBody weight (same day/time/conditions)\nPrimary lift e1RMs (calculated from top sets)\nProgress photos (front/side/back, same lighting)\nWaist circumference @ navel\nWeekly:\nAverage sleep hours\nSubjective stress (1-10 scale)\nSession RPE (1-10, logged 30min post-workout)","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-03-14T13:21:52.339Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["LOWER STRENGTH-POWER","UPPER HYPERTROPHY","LOWER HYPERTROPHY","UPPER STRENGTH-POWER"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Seated Box Jump","sets":[{"r":3,"rpe":10,"x":4}]}]},{"n":"Trap Bar Deadlift","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":7,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":7,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Lying Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Single-Leg Calf Raise (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"2-1-2 tempo"}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"T-Bar Row","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Leg Press (45 Degrees)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":